  "english": [
    "<b>this light bread”</b> (Numbers 21:5), despite the fact it was the highest-quality food. Moses further called them <b>children of ingrates, as it is written</b> that after sinning and eating from the tree of knowledge, Adam said: <b>“The woman whom You gave to be with me, she gave me of the tree, and I did eat”</b> (Genesis 3:12). Adam complained that the woman had been given to him in order to cause him to sin, whereas in fact she had been given to him to serve as a helpmate.",
    "Yet <b>even Moses our teacher,</b> who said this to the Jewish people, <b>did not allude to the Jewish people until after forty years</b> that they should have stated this request, <b>as it is stated: “And I have led you forty years in the wilderness”</b> (Deuteronomy 29:4), which shows that Moses was speaking forty years after the revelation at Sinai. <b>And</b> at that point <b>it is written: “But the Lord has not given you a heart</b> to know, and eyes to see, and ears to hear, until this day” (Deuteronomy 29:3). <b>Rabba said: Conclude from</b> here that <b>a person does not understand the opinion of his teacher until</b> after <b>forty years,</b> as Moses said this to the Jewish people only after forty years of learning Torah.",
    "<b>Rabbi Yoḥanan says in the name of Rabbi Bana’a: What</b> is the meaning of that <b>which is written: “Happy are you that sow beside all waters, that send forth freely the feet of the ox and the donkey”</b> (Isaiah 32:20)? <b>Happy are you Israel; when they,</b> i.e., the Jewish people, <b>engage in Torah</b> study <b>and in acts of kindness, their</b> evil <b>inclination is given over to them, and they are not given over to their</b> evil <b>inclination, as it is stated: “Happy are you that sow beside all waters.” And</b> the term <b>sowing</b> is referring to <b>nothing other than</b> performing <b>charitable</b> deeds, <b>as it is stated: “Sow to yourselves according to charitableness, reap according to mercy”</b> (Hosea 10:12). <b>And</b> the term <b>waters</b> is referring to <b>nothing other than</b> the <b>Torah, as it is stated: “Ho, every one that thirsts, come for water”</b> (Isaiah 55:1).",
    "With regard to the continuation of the verse: <b>“That send forth freely the feet of the ox and the donkey,”</b> one of the Sages of <b>the school of Eliyahu taught: A person should always make himself</b> subjugated <b>to matters of Torah like an ox to a yoke and like a donkey to a burden.</b>",
    "§ After concluding its long introduction, the Gemara analyzes the mishna. The mishna taught that on <b>the three days</b> before the festivals of gentiles <b>it is prohibited to engage with them in business</b> or to lend them items. The Gemara asks: <b>And</b> is it the practice of a gentile to buy an animal so far in advance of his festival that it is <b>required</b> of Jews to refrain from selling an animal to idol worshippers for <b>all of these</b> days before their festivals?",
    "<b>But didn’t we learn</b> in a mishna (<i>Ḥullin</i> 83a): <b>On four occasions during the year one who sells an animal to another is required to inform him: I sold the mother of</b> this animal today for the buyer <b>to slaughter</b> it, or: <b>I sold the daughter of</b> this animal today for the buyer <b>to slaughter</b> it. This notification is necessary so that this buyer will not slaughter the animal on the same day that its mother or its young is slaughtered, thereby violating the prohibition: “You shall not kill it and its young both in one day” (Leviticus 22:28).",
    "The mishna continues: <b>And those</b> four occasions <b>are: The eve of the last day of the festival</b> of <i>Sukkot</i>, <b>the eve of the first day of the festival of Passover, and the eve of <i>Shavuot</i>, and the eve of Rosh HaShana. And according to the statement of Rabbi Yosei HaGelili, the eve of Yom Kippur in the Galilee</b> is included <b>as well.</b> This mishna indicates that one prepares for a festival for only one day prior to the event. Why does the mishna here prohibit sales three days prior to gentile festivals?",
    "The Gemara answers: <b>There,</b> in the mishna in <i>Ḥullin</i>, <b>where</b> the animal is purchased <b>for consumption, it is sufficient</b> to prepare <b>one day</b> before the festival. <b>Here,</b> in the case of this mishna, where the animal is purchased <b>for sacrifice,</b> the gentile <b>requires three days</b> to ensure that the animal has no blemish. The Gemara asks: <b>And for</b> the purpose of <b>sacrifice,</b> is it <b>sufficient</b> to prepare merely <b>three days</b> in advance? <b>But didn’t we learn</b> in a <i>baraita</i>: <b>One</b> begins to <b>ask about the <i>halakhot</i> of Passover thirty days before Passover; Rabban Shimon ben Gamliel says:</b> One begins to inquire only <b>two weeks</b> before Passover. According to both opinions, far more than three days are needed in order to begin preparing for the sacrifice of an offering. One can assume that the same applies to gentiles.",
    "The Gemara answers: <b>We</b> Jews, <b>for whom blemishes that disqualify</b> the animal <b>are common,</b> as <b>even</b> a small blemish <b>on the cornea of the eye</b> disqualifies it, <b>we require thirty days</b> to prepare for the sacrificial offerings of the festivals. By contrast, with regard to <b>them,</b> gentiles, <b>they hold</b> that the only blemish that disqualifies the animal is if it is <b>lacking</b> an entire <b>limb;</b> therefore, <b>three days are sufficient</b> for them to prepare for the sacrifice.",
    "<b>As Rabbi Elazar says: From where</b> is it derived with regard to an animal <b>that is lacking a limb, that it is prohibited for descendants of Noah</b> to sacrifice it as an offering? <b>As it is written: “And of every living thing of all flesh, two of every</b> sort you shall bring into the ark, to keep them alive with you” (Genesis 6:19). In this verse <b>the Torah states: Bring an animal whose extremities are alive,</b> as some of those animals were to be used later as offerings.",
    "The Gemara asks: Isn’t <b>that</b> verse <b>required</b> to teach <b>that an animal with a wound that will cause it to die within twelve months [<i>tereifa</i>] is not</b> fit to be sacrificed as an offering? The Gemara answers: The disqualification of <b>a <i>tereifa</i> is derived from</b> the phrase: <b>“To keep seed alive”</b> (Genesis 7:3), as a <i>tereifa</i> cannot propagate. The Gemara asks: <b>This works out well according to the one who says</b> that <b>a <i>tereifa</i> cannot give birth.</b> According to this opinion, the disqualification of a missing limb is derived from the phrase: “Of every living thing,” while the disqualification of a <i>tereifa</i> is learned from the phrase: “To keep seed alive.”"
  ],
  "gemara": [
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"0\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>בַּלֶּחֶם הַקְּלֹקֵל״. בְּנֵי כְּפוּיֵי טוֹבָה, דִּכְתִיב:",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "״הָאִשָּׁה אֲשֶׁר נָתַתָּה עִמָּדִי הִיא נָתְנָה לִּי מִן",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "הָעֵץ וָאֹכֵל״. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"1\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אַף מֹשֶׁה רַבֵּינוּ לֹא רְמָזָהּ לָהֶן",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לְיִשְׂרָאֵל אֶלָּא לְאַחַר אַרְבָּעִים שָׁנָה, שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר:",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "״וָאוֹלֵךְ אֶתְכֶם בַּמִּדְבָּר אַרְבָּעִים שָׁנָה״, וּכְתִיב:",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "״וְלֹא נָתַן ה׳ לָכֶם לֵב וְגוֹ׳״. אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabba bar Naḥmani, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2581\" data-full-name=\"Rabba bar Naḥmani\" data-name-he=\"רַבָּה בַּר נַחְמָנִי\">רַבָּה</span>: שְׁמַע מִינַּהּ",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לָא קָאֵי אִינִישׁ אַדַּעְתֵּיהּ דְּרַבֵּיהּ עַד אַרְבְּעִין",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "שְׁנִין. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"2\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan II, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1570\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan II\" data-name-he=\"רבי יוחנן\">רַבִּי יוֹחָנָן</span> מִשּׁוּם <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabbi Bena’a, first-generation I Amora\" data-authority-id=\"687\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Bena’a\" data-name-he=\"רבי בנאה\">רַבִּי בְּנָאָה</span>, מַאי",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "דִּכְתִיב: ״אַשְׁרֵיכֶם זֹרְעֵי עַל כׇּל מָיִם מְשַׁלְּחֵי",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "רֶגֶל הַשּׁוֹר וְהַחֲמוֹר״? אַשְׁרֵיהֶם יִשְׂרָאֵל בִּזְמַן",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "שֶׁעוֹסְקִין בְּתוֹרָה וּבִגְמִילוּת חֲסָדִים, יִצְרָם",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "מָסוּר בְּיָדָם וְאֵין הֵם מְסוּרִים בְּיַד יִצְרָם,",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר: ״אַשְׁרֵיכֶם זֹרְעֵי עַל כׇּל מָיִם״, וְאֵין",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "זְרִיעָה אֶלָּא צְדָקָה, שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר: ״זִרְעוּ לָכֶם לִצְדָקָה",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "וְקִצְרוּ לְפִי חֶסֶד״, וְאֵין מַיִם אֶלָּא תּוֹרָה, שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר:",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "״הוֹי כׇּל צָמֵא לְכוּ לַמַּיִם״. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"3\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>״מְשַׁלְּחֵי רֶגֶל הַשּׁוֹר",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "וְהַחֲמוֹר״, תָּנָא דְּבֵי אֵלִיָּהוּ: לָעוֹלָם יָשִׂים אָדָם",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "עַצְמוֹ עַל דִּבְרֵי תוֹרָה כְּשׁוֹר לְעוֹל וְכַחֲמוֹר",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לְמַשּׂאוֹי<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"3\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span> <span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"9\" data-sentence-id=\"4\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"א\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"4\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><a class=\"piska-quote-link\" data-piska-quote-group=\"piska-quote-4\" href=\"/avodah_zarah/2a#gemara-line-2\" title=\"Mishnah source: Avodah Zarah 2a\">שְׁלֹשָׁה יָמִים אָסוּר לָשֵׂאת וְלָתֵת עִמָּהֶם</a>",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<a class=\"piska-quote-link\" data-piska-quote-group=\"piska-quote-4\" href=\"/avodah_zarah/2a#gemara-line-2\" title=\"Mishnah source: Avodah Zarah 2a\">וְכוּ׳</a><span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"4\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span> וּמִי בָּעִינַן כּוּלֵּי הַאי? <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"5\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>וְהָתְנַן: בְּאַרְבָּעָה",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "פְּרָקִים בַּשָּׁנָה, הַמּוֹכֵר בְּהֵמָה לַחֲבֵירוֹ צָרִיךְ",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לְהוֹדִיעוֹ: ״אִמָּהּ מָכַרְתִּי לִשְׁחוֹט״, ״בִּתָּהּ מָכַרְתִּי",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לִשְׁחוֹט״. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"6\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>וְאֵלּוּ הֵן: עֶרֶב יוֹם טוֹב הָאַחֲרוֹן שֶׁל חַג, עֶרֶב יוֹם טוֹב",
      "segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "הָרִאשׁוֹן שֶׁל פֶּסַח, וְעֶרֶב עֲצֶרֶת, וְעֶרֶב רֹאשׁ הַשָּׁנָה,",
      "segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "וּכְדִבְרֵי <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Yosei HaGelili, fourth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"1742\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yosei HaGelili\" data-name-he=\"רבי יוסי הגלילי\">רַבִּי יוֹסֵי הַגְּלִילִי</span> — אַף עֶרֶב יוֹם הַכִּפּוּרִים בַּגָּלִיל!",
      "segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"7\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>הָתָם דְּלַאֲכִילָה, סַגִּיא בְּחַד יוֹמָא. הָכָא",
      "segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "דִּלְהַקְרָבָה, בָּעִינַן תְּלָתָא יוֹמֵי. וּלְהַקְרָבָה סַגִּי",
      "segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "בִּתְלָתָא יוֹמֵי? וְהָתְנַן: שׁוֹאֲלִין בְּהִלְכוֹת",
      "segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "הַפֶּסַח קוֹדֶם הַפֶּסַח שְׁלֹשִׁים יוֹם, <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabban Shimon ben Gamliel II, fifth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"2852\" data-full-name=\"Rabban Shimon ben Gamliel II\" data-name-he=\"רבן שמעון בן גמליאל\">רַבָּן שִׁמְעוֹן בֶּן גַּמְלִיאֵל</span> אוֹמֵר:",
      "segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "שְׁתֵּי שַׁבָּתוֹת. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"8\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אֲנַן דִּשְׁכִיחִי מוּמִין דְּפָסְלִי,",
      "segment_ids": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אֲפִילּוּ בְּדוּקִּין שֶׁבָּעַיִן, בָּעִינַן תְּלָתִין יוֹמִין; אִינְהוּ,",
      "segment_ids": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "דִּמְחוּסַּר אֵבֶר אִית לְהוּ, בִּתְלָתָא יוֹמֵי סַגִּי. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"9\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>דְּאָמַר",
      "segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabbi Elazar ben Pedat, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"467\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Elazar ben Pedat\" data-name-he=\"רַבִּי אֶלְעָזָר בֶּן פְּדָת\" data-resolution-rule=\"amora_context\" data-resolution-explanation=\"Resolved from nearby amoraic interlocutors and discourse.\" data-resolution-reasons=\"[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;heuristic&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Amora context&quot;,&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;Resolved from nearby amoraic interlocutors and discourse.&quot;,&quot;attribution&quot;:&quot;Girsology disambiguation heuristics&quot;}]\">רַבִּי אֶלְעָזָר</span>: מִנַּיִן לִמְחוּסַּר אֵבֶר דְּאָסוּר לִבְנֵי",
      "segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "נֹחַ? דִּכְתִיב: ״וּמִכׇּל הָחַי מִכׇּל בָּשָׂר שְׁנַיִם",
      "segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "מִכֹּל וְגוֹ׳״, אָמְרָה תּוֹרָה: הָבֵא בְּהֵמָה שֶׁחַיִּין",
      "segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "רָאשֵׁי אֵבָרִים שֶׁלָּהּ. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"10\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>הַאי מִיבְּעֵי לֵיהּ לְמַעוֹטֵי",
      "segment_ids": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "טְרֵיפָה דְּלָא! טְרֵיפָה מִ״לְּחַיּוֹת זֶרַע״ נָפְקָא.",
      "segment_ids": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "הָנִיחָא לְמַאן דְּאָמַר טְרֵיפָה אֵינָהּ יוֹלֶדֶת,",
      "segment_ids": [
        10
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rashi": [
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>בַּלֶּחֶם <span class=\"dh-divergent\">הקלוקל</span>.</b> קל הוא המן ומפני שהיה נבלע בכל אבריהם ואינן",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:1:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "יוצאין לחוץ קראוהו קלוקל ורגנו על כך והיא היתה להם טובה גדולה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:1:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שלא היו צריכין לטרוח ולצאת שלש פרסאות לפנות דתניא (ברכות דף",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:1:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ס) כשהן נפנין אין נפנין לא לצידיהן ולא לפניהן אלא לאחריהן",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:1:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ומחנה ישראל ג' פרסאות היה: <b>אֲשֶׁר</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>נָתַתָּה עִמָּדִי.</b> לשון גנאי הוא שתולה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "הקלקלה במתנתו של מקום והוא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:1:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "עשאה לו לעזר: <b>לֹא רְמָזָהּ.</b> לתוכחה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "זו אלא לאחר מ' שנה במשנה תורה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בערבות מואב אמר להם ולא נתן לכם",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לב לדעת שתהיו יודעים לשאול מה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "היה מבקש מכם [אלמא] אף משה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "רבינו לא נזכר לתת על לבו דבר זה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "עד מ' שנה: <b>לָא קָאֵי אִינִישׁ אַדַּעְתֵּיהּ</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>דְּרַבֵּיהּ.</b> לדעת סוף דעתו ותבונתו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "עד מ' שנה שהרי משה לא רמזה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לישראל עד מ' שנה: <b>מְשַׁלְּחֵי רֶגֶל.</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "משלחים ומשליכין רגלי יצר הרע",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "הבא על האדם מעליהם. יצר הרע",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "קרוי אורח כדכתיב ויבא הלך לאיש",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "העשיר (<a href=\"https://www.sefaria.org/II_Samuel.12.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-sefaria-ref=\"II_Samuel.12.4\">שמואל ב י״ב:ד׳</a>): <b>וּמִי בָּעִינַן כּוּלֵּי</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:5:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>הַאי.</b> דחיישינן דזבין לה עובד כוכבים",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:5:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "להאי בהמה לצורך יום אידו ג' ימים",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:5:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "קודם לכן: <b><span class=\"dh-divergent\">בהני</span> <span class=\"dh-divergent\">ד&#x27;</span> <span class=\"dh-divergent\">פרקים</span>.</b> מחזקינן",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:6:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ליה לאינש דכל מאן דזבין בהמה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:6:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שחיט לה ביומיה ומשום הכי קאמר",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:6:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "אמה מכרתי לשחוט ואל תשחט אתה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:6:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "את הבת שאמכור משום אותו ואת בנו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:6:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דביום אחד מחייב האחרון ואלו ימים",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:6:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "א\"א בלא בשר וקונין הכל: <b>עֶרֶב</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:7:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b><span class=\"dh-divergent\">יו&amp;quot;ט</span> הָאַחֲרוֹן שֶׁל חַג.</b> מפני שהוא יום",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:7:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "השלמת קרבנות החג דתנן מי שלא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:7:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "חג וכו': <b>וי&quot;ד דניסן</b> משום פסחים:",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:7:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>ערב עצרת</b> משום שלמי חגיגה"
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ועולת ראיה: <b><span class=\"dh-divergent\">וכן</span> <span class=\"dh-divergent\">לר&quot;ה</span></b> יום טוב",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:7:4",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "הוא ואוכלין בשר: <b>ויוה&quot;כ.</b> נמי",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:7:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "משום כל האוכל ושותה בט' בו וכו':",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:7:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>בַּגָּלִיל.</b> היו רגילין להרבות שמחה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:7:6",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "יותר. קתני ערב יום טוב אלמא לא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:7:6",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "זבין איניש מקמי סעודה אלא חד",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:7:6",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "יומא ואילו מכרה אתמול לא היה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:7:6",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מזהיר לו היום דהא אין אדם קונה ג'",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:7:6",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ימים קודם לכן צרכי סעודת יום ג':",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:7:6",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b><span class=\"dh-divergent\">להקרבה</span></b> לעבודת כוכבים עובד",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "כוכבים מחזר אחריה ג' ימים: <b>בְּדוּקִּין</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "טיל\"א בלע\"ז: <b>דְּאָסוּר לִבְנֵי נֹחַ.</b> להקריב",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לגבוה ודומיא דקרבנות שנהגו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "אבותיהם לשמים הן נוהגין לעבודת",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "כוכבים שלהן: <b>״וּמִכׇּל הָחַי.</b> על שם שהיה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "",
      "left": "",
      "text": "עתיד נח להקריב מהן דכתי' ויקח מכל הבהמה הטהורה וגו' (<a href=\"https://www.sefaria.org/Genesis.8.20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-sefaria-ref=\"Genesis.8.20\">בראשית ח׳:כ׳</a>):",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    }
  ],
  "vilna_piskaot": [
    {
      "id": 3,
      "symbol": "׃",
      "raw_symbol": "׃",
      "line_number": 19
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "symbol": "׃",
      "raw_symbol": "׃",
      "line_number": 20,
      "mishnah_ref": "Avodah Zarah 2a",
      "mishnah_href": "/avodah_zarah/2a#gemara-line-2",
      "mishnah_line_number": 2,
      "quote_text": "שְׁלֹשָׁה יָמִים אָסוּר לָשֵׂאת וְלָתֵת עִמָּהֶם וְכוּ׳"
    }
  ],
  "steinsaltz_sugyot": [
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "line_number": 19,
      "label": "א"
    }
  ],
  "tosafot": [
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<big><b>יִצְרָם</b></big> דריש ליה ממשלחי רגל דיצה\"ר נקרא אורח",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:8:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "400px",
      "right": "50px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "כדכתיב ויבא הלך לאיש העשיר. <big><b>וּמִי.</b></big>",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "פירש רש\"י וכי אדם רגיל כ\"כ להעלות על לבו שמחתו וחגו דאסרת",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ג' ימים קודם לפי שהוא יום איד של עבודת כוכבים ונזכר שם עבודת",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "כוכבים תדיר בפיו ואזיל ומודי והתנן",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בד' פרקים וכו'. ומסיק התם דלאכילה",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שאינו טרוד לפני החג אלא על עסקי",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "אכילה סגי בחד יומא הכא דלהקרבה",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שצריך לחזר אחר עסקי הקרבה בעי",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "תלתא יומי והלכך אסור לשאת ולתת",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בכל עניני מקח וממכר משום דשם",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "עבודת כוכבים שגור בפיו ואזיל ומודי.",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:9:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<big><b>עֶרֶב.</b></big> הא",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "210px",
      "right": "40px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דלא נקט (יום) הראשון של",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "חג? לפי שהם טרודים במצות לולב",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "וסוכה ואין להם פנאי להרבות",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בסעודות. וי\"מ דבהנך ארבעה פרקים",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "טעמא רבה אית בהו. יו\"ט האחרון",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "של חג לפי שהוא זמן בפ\"ע וחלוק",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "משלפניו תקנו להרבות בסעודה",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "משא\"כ בשביעי של פסח. וגם הקרבנות",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שבשמיני היו בשביל ישראל וכל החג",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "היו מקריבין נגד העובדי כוכבים.",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "וערב פסח לפי שהוא יום גאולה",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ויציאה לחירות. ועצרת כדאמרינן בפרק",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "אלו דברים (<a href=\"/pesachim/68b\">פסחים דף סח:</a>) הכל",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מודים בעצרת דבעינן נמי לכם. ור\"ה",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מפני שהוא תחלת השנה מרבים",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בסעודה לעשות סימן יפה וכמה עניני'",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "עושים בו לסימן יפה כדאמר במסכת",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "הוריות (<a href=\"/horayot/12a\">דף יב.</a>) וכריתות (<a href=\"/keritot/5b\">דף ה:</a>).",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:10:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<big><b>וּכְדִבְרֵי.</b></big>",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:11:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "180px",
      "right": "70px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "תימה בפ\"ק דכתובות",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:11:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "(ה. ושם ד\"ה אלא) דפריך תלמודא יוה\"כ",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:11:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שחל להיות בשני בשבת ידחה גזרה",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:11:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שמא ישחוט בן עוף ואמאי שביק כל",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:11:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "הני פרקים דד\"ה ופריך לדברי רבי",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:11:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "יוסי הגלילי? וי\"ל דשפיר פריך אליבא",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:11:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דרבנן דעיקר פירכיה מבן עוף דוקא",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:11:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דבהמה איכא טירחא יתירה להפילה",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:11:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ומידכר. ובפרקים אלו אינם רגילין רק",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:11:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בבהמות וביוה\"כ רגילים בעופות ודגים",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:11:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ודברים קלים כדאמרינן בב\"ר (פ'",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:11:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "יא) עובדא בההוא חייטא דזבן חד",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:11:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "נונא תריסר דינרין. <big><b>וְהָתְנַן.</b></big>",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:12:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ואע\"פ שגם עתה",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:12:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שאין קרבן שואלין בהלכות הפסח",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:12:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "קודם ל' יום. מ\"מ עיקר התקנה על",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:12:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "הקרבן נתקנה כדאמר טעמא בפ\"ק",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:12:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דפסחים (<a href=\"/pesachim/6b\">דף ו:</a>) שהרי נביא עומד בפסח ראשון ומזהיר על פסח",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:12:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שני. <big><b>מִנַּיִן.</b></big> פירוש להקריב לגבוה בבמה שלהן",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:13:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דאילו בבית המקדש אפי' בדוקין שבעין נמי אסור דכתיב ומיד בן נכר לא תקריבו ומייתי ליה ומכל החי דהזהיר הקב\"ה לנח להביא",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:13:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מחוסר אבר בתיבה מפני שעתיד להביא מהם קרבן. וא\"ת הא לקמן בסמוך (<a href=\"/avodah_zarah/6a\">דף ו.</a>) אמר דהזהירו נמי מלהביא אל התיבה זקן",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:13:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "וסריס ולא נאסרו לבני נח. ועוד קשיא דקרא גבי בהמה טמאה כתיב שהם שנים שנים דכתיב ומכל החי מכל בשר שנים מכל תביא וגו'",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:13:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "והנהו לאו בני קרבן נינהו אף לבני נח כדמשמע פרק בתרא דזבחים (<a href=\"/zevachim/116a\">דף קטז.</a>)? וי\"ל דאין לאסור אלו זקן וסריס לקרבן במה שמעטם",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:13:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מהבאת התיבה כיון דאיכא טעמא אחרינא דאיכא למימר דהא דמעטן הכתוב היינו לפי שאינם ראוין לקיום העולם אבל מחוסר אבר אי לאו",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:13:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לאסרן לקרבן למה נמעטו מלהביאם לתיבה הרי הם ראוין לקיום העולם. ולבהמה טמאה ע\"כ נמי לא מצי קאי דכיון דשלמים נמי לא",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:13:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "חזו להקרבה. <big><b>מִנַּיִן.</b></big> יש לדקדק מלשון אסור שהוא איסור גמור ובן נח מוזהר בדבר. ותימה מ\"ט לא חשיב",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:14:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ליה בהדי ז' מצות שנצטוו ויתחייבו עליו מיתה? ואין לומר משום דאזהרתיה לא כתיבא בהדיא. הא מכלל הן אתה שומע לאו כדדרשינן מכל",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:14:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "עץ הגן אכל תאכל ולא גזל ודבק באשתו ולא באשת חברו. אלא י\"ל דהאי קום עשה הוא דמאיש איש מרבינן שהעובדי כוכבים",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:14:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "נודרים נדרים ונדבות כישראל ואם נדר מחוסר אבר אמרינן ליה קום והבא קרבן שלם וקום ועשה לא קחשיב. והא דאמרינן פ\"ק דקדושין",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:14:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "(<a href=\"/avodah_zarah/24b\">דף כד:</a>) דמצרכינן מן העוף ולא כל העוף למעוטי יבשה גפה נקטע רגלה ל\"ל פשיטא דמי איכא מידי דלישראל שרי ולעובד כוכבים אסור.",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:14:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "וי\"ל דס\"ד כיון ששאר מומין הפוסלין בבהמה הותרו בעוף כדאמרינן תמות וזכרות בבהמה ואין תמות וזכרות בעוף ובבהמה אין חילוק בין",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:14:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "במומין בין במחוסר אבר בעוף נמי נימא כיון שהותרו המומין מחוסר אבר נמי נשתרי קמ\"ל מן העוף. ועוד י\"ל דאי לא כתיב מן העוף לאסור",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:14:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מחוסר אבר לישראל הוה אמינא דבני נח משתרו והכתוב בא לאסור לישראל אע\"ג דכתיב גבי בני נח. כדאמר בפ' ארבע מיתות (סנהדרין דף",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:14:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "930px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "נט.) כל מצוה שנאמרה לבני נח ולא נשנית בסיני לישראל נאמרה ולא לבני נח נשנית בסיני לזה ולזה נאמרה [וע\"ע תוס' זבחים סח: ד\"ה ושניסמית].",
      "source_ref": "Tosafot on Avodah Zarah 5b:14:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        9
      ]
    }
  ]
}